THIRD-PARTY LICENSES
====================

OneJournal itself is MIT licensed — see LICENSE.

This file covers third-party material redistributed inside this repository.
Python dependencies (Flask, Jinja2, Werkzeug, pandas, numpy, python-dateutil,
python-dotenv and their own requirements) are not listed here: pip fetches
them at install time inside the container and their licenses ship with them.
The Tailwind CSS compiler (MIT) is likewise downloaded by the Docker build and
is not part of this repository.

Three JavaScript libraries, one stylesheet, two font files and a set of icon
shapes are redistributed, each covered below. They are bundled so the app
makes no network request while it runs.


